            "notes": "[Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is a must.\n\n[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) is amazing to have under all the natural  [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317) shielding.\n\nIf they have a [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9), swap [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) and run it pretty much all game.\n\n---\n\nWhy is [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) more important thatn [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)?  In general, with small projectiles that don't have splash damage, you want rate of fire over  outright damage to maximize _hits_.",
