            "notes": "It's surprisingly easy to get 15K+ in the first round so splurge!  Prioritize [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and then [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a).   Throw in some greens as filler.\n\n---\n\nWhile I tend to favour attack speed over damage in this round, If you were getting dove a lot in Round 1, [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) may make more sense as a priority, particularly because it makes your kick more powerful.",
