            "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:54:12.723408+00:00",
            "notes": "Definitely time for  [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3)  now, even if you have to sell stuff.\n\nI'd sell  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) before  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) because the latter gives you better mobility.  It may not be much but everything counts.\n\n---\n\nAnd yes, [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) is still a valuable option if you're getting spammed.",
