            "created_at": "2025-09-21T03:54:12.723408+00:00",
            "notes": "[Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) applies damage for 5 seconds which can be used to proc all sorts of effects.\n\nMy favourites are [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) both of which are excellent tools to use when you're getting dived (doved?)\n\n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is also very strong.\n\nOn the Survival side, keep [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) in mind. [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54)'s fire is incredibly powerful by now.\n\n---\n\nIf you can afford it,  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) for pure AP power to make that [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) very very painful.",
